<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_767_2017.JPG" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser fründtlich willig diennst, sampt was wir eeren liebs unnd guots <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermoegennnd</unclear> zuovor,
<lb n="2"/>fromm, fürsichtig, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eersam</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wÿß</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">insonnders</unclear> guott fründ, unnd getrüw lieb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eÿdtgnossen</unclear>.
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Üwer</unclear> an unns <date resp="#ner">23 diß monadts</date> ußgangen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schrÿben</unclear>, haben wir, sampt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darÿn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelaegner</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nüwen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zÿttung</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gnuogsamlich</unclear> verstannden, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wiewol</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derselbigen</unclear> schon <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hievoor</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bricht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gwaesen</unclear>, so dannckend
<lb n="5"/>wir üch doch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nüdtdeßminder</unclear> zum hoechsten, üwers guotten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gneigten</unclear> willens, so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> zuo unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tragend</unclear>,
<lb n="6"/>unnd des <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffsechens</unclear>, so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wenndung</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmeÿner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">loblicher</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eÿdtgnoßschafft</unclear></orgName> schadens,
<lb n="7"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürderung</unclear> derselben wolfart <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habend</unclear>, mitt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erpiettung</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wo</unclear> wir inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anndergstalt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oderr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ützit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glÿchem</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meererm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fahl</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">koendten</unclear>, oder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moechtend</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bschůldenn</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verdienenn</unclear>,
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dheins</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waegs</unclear> ze <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sparen</unclear>, sonnders alle <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moegliche</unclear> fründtschafft, unnd liebe <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zůwÿßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aůllezytt</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>gantz <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guottwillig</unclear>, unnd gneigt finden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zelassen</unclear>, unnd so wir ettwas <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nüwer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zÿttung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernemend</unclear>,
<lb n="11"/>üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dero</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glÿcher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gstalt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zebrichten</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hienebennnd</unclear> lanngt an üch unnser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pitt</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bgaer</unclear>,
<lb n="12"/>daß ir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dasselbig</unclear> ouch thuon, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dwÿl</unclear> ir an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anstoessen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsaessen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spach</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kuntschafft</unclear>
<lb n="13"/>an denen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ortthen</unclear>, da <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einer</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eÿdtgnoßschafft</unclear></orgName>, ettwas <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gefar</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obglaegen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zemachen</unclear>, unnd was
<lb n="14"/>üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">je</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begegnen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wirt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">güttlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zebrichten</unclear>. Das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bgaerennd</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guottwillig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zverdienen</unclear>,
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitt</unclear> hilff des <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allmaechtigen</unclear>, der üch inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glicksaeligem</unclear> regiment erhalten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woelle</unclear>. Datum
<lb n="16"/><origDate when="1557" resp="#ner">penultima <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">augusti</unclear> 1557</origDate>.
<lb n="17"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-514" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schulthais</unclear> unnd rhatt
<lb n="18"/>zuo Bernn</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_767_2018.JPG" n="2"/>
<lb n="19"/>Den frommen, fuersichtigen, ersammen,
<lb n="20"/>wyßen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rhatt</unclear> der
<lb n="21"/>Statt Sant Gallen</orgName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnseren</unclear> innsonders
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotten</unclear> fründen unnd getrüwen lieben
<lb n="23"/>Eydtgnossen.
</p>
